[{"title":"黄山汤泉","author":"凌唐佐","text":"一道出遥岑，潺湲古到今。\n雪天声泻玉，月夜影摇金。\n岁旱施功大，民情被泽深。\n容成与轩帝，仙迹可追寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64684,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鍊丹灶","author":"凌唐佐","text":"鍊丹峰畔隐轩皇，石臼空存岁月长。\n林下宛然含净色，风前依旧发馀香。\n虽留此地千般药，难问当时九转方。\n独向溪头重拂拭，五云何处日茫茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64685,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洗药溪","author":"凌唐佐","text":"红泉声里独徘徊，帝子当年洗药来。\n怪底馀香至今在，四时芝朮有花开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64686,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书蔡元长堂","author":"释妙应","text":"相得端明似虎形，摇头攞脑得人憎。\n看取明年作宰相，张牙劈口吃众生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64687,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"释妙应","text":"姓名不过程家渡，出郭犹行十里村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64688,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"建炎四年正月二十五日过南山诗","author":"赵子松","text":"□望□□洞，北□刻划兼无双。\n怪□□奇□，□□□□□。\n虬龙□□脊，彪兕怒翀羾。\n□□作澒洞，哀湍泻春撞。\n磨崖名相踵，快意言多哤。\n赏心或自得，有力谁扛。\n想当秋水至，万壑争淙淙。\n仙圣会缥缈，松竹导旌幢。\n祇今岩岫间，彷佛馀舌杠。\n岂无避世翁，台背霜眉庞。\n□许寻子真，不辞拜老庞。\n华发去乡国，炎荒寄逢窗。\n偶著两□历，端令寸心降。\n危守跂鸟翼，旅食空酒缸。\n归鸦识故栖，野烧明枯桩。\n送客雨霖霏，催□鼓逢逢。\n推枕耿不寐，取火续寒缸。\n哦诗杂蛮语，嘲哳愧新腔。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64689,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"世綵堂","author":"朱震","text":"公家王母九十馀，大父侍立垂白须。\n子孙还如祖妣寿，康强不用旁人扶。\n谁家高曾见五世，不比徐卿生二雏。\n闻说一门能养志，膳羞壶酒随亲意。\n畏暑黄童扇枕忙，学啼莱子斑衣戏。\n发为碧落新除吏，儿齿童眉复骀背。\n得寿当如卫武好，著书拟迈张苍贵。\n饵菊三公未闻道，芳泉万斛空劳费。\n岂知安乐便延年，无意益生生自至。\n高堂大幅垂轻绢，画出婵娟金翠翘。\n不如画出綵衣去，使人知德如唐尧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64690,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释守遂","text":"一拳拳倒黄鹤楼，一踏踏翻鹦鹉洲。\n惯向高楼骤玉马，曾于急水打金毬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64691,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释大通","text":"上不见天，下不见地。\n畐塞虚空，无处回避。\n为君明破即不中，且向南山鳖鼻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64692,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释岩","text":"乾坤肃静，海晏河清。\n风不鸣条，雨不破块。\n春生夏长，秋收冬藏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64693,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其一","author":"释岩","text":"雨后鸠鸣，山前麦熟。\n何处牧儿，骑牛笑相逐。\n莫把短笛横吹，风前一曲两曲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64694,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其二","author":"释岩","text":"衲僧现前三昧，释迦老子不会。\n住世四十九年，说得天花乱坠。\n争似饥餐渴饮，展脚堂中打睡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64695,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其三","author":"释岩","text":"诸人知处，山僧尽知。\n山僧知处，诸人不知。\n头上是天，脚下是地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64696,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其四","author":"释岩","text":"一境谁相到，翛然绝点尘。\n天花莫狼藉，吾匪解空人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64697,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈五首 其五","author":"释岩","text":"樵夫跣足下层峦，大笑渔翁溪上寒。\n山色横担廛市去，家家门底透长安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64698,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释慧印","text":"韶石渡头，舟横野水。\n汾阳浪里，棹发孤烟。\n云月无私，溪山岂异。\n一言合辙，千里同风。\n八千弟子今何在，万里山河属帝家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64699,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释宗一","text":"美玉藏顽石，莲花出淤泥。\n须知烦恼处，悟得即菩提。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64700,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释惟白","text":"过去已过去，未来且莫算。\n正当现在事，今朝正月半。\n明月正团圆，打鼓普请看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64701,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释晓通","text":"冷似秋潭月，无心合太虚。\n山高流水急，何处驻游鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64702,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释子英","text":"节目分明，生来条直。\n冰雪敲开片片分，白云点破承伊力。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64703,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释法因","text":"天上月圆，人间月半。\n七八是数，事却难算。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64704,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释法因","text":"祖师妙诀，别无可说，直饶钉觜铁舌。\n未免弄巧成拙，净名已把天机泄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64705,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释仁绘","text":"至道无难，唯嫌拣择。\n但莫憎爱，洞然明白。\n山僧则不然，至道最难，须是拣择。\n若无憎爱，争见明白。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64706,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其一","author":"释自龄","text":"月里走金乌，谁云一物无。\n赵州东壁上，挂个大胡芦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64707,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其二","author":"释自龄","text":"五千馀卷诠不尽，三世诸佛赞不及。\n令人却忆卖油翁，狼忙走下绳床立。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64708,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其三","author":"释自龄","text":"便乃忘机守默，已被金粟占先。\n拟欲展演词锋，落在瞿昙之后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64709,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释真悟","text":"扬声止响，不知声是响根。\n弄影逃形，不知形为影本。\n以法问法，不知法本非法。\n以心传心，不知心本无心。\n心本无心，知心如幻。\n了法非法，知法如梦。\n心法不实，莫谩追求。\n梦幻空花，何劳把捉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64710,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释灯","text":"天不能盖，地不能载。\n一室无私，何处不在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64711,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净土院","author":"虞谟","text":"法界惟心现，真风触处凉。\n具茨非有路，建德岂须粮。\n地僻远尘世，境幽闻妙香。\n此山斯净土，不必往西方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64712,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观海","author":"郭异","text":"汹汹澜无际，滔滔势欲东。\n百川容莫量，三岛杳难穷。\n天淡祠堂古，云低客路通。\n暂来回首懒，归辔逐西风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64713,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪岩山六题 其一 石门","author":"王辅世","text":"岩穴神仙宅，山门向岭开。\n时横云作钥，怕有俗人来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64714,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪岩山六题 其二 石金刚","author":"王辅世","text":"天地应怜我，遗留钜力神。\n定须凭国手，神妙与传真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64715,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪岩山六题 其三 仙人台","author":"王辅世","text":"任峻我须上，更高人亦行。\n神仙虽已往，咫尺是蓬瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64716,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪岩山六题 其四 石猴","author":"王辅世","text":"猿猴尝学禅，立德固坚久。\n能乘狮子游，不为狮子后。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64717,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪岩山六题 其五 山风","author":"王辅世","text":"山露湿吾履，山风吹我衣。\n白云褰举处，依约认崖扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64718,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪岩山六题 其六 石山鸡","author":"王辅世","text":"山鸡化为石，锦翼已成藏。\n俗类休争食，吾心不为粱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64719,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留题净相院橙轩","author":"彭迪明","text":"万叶扶疏双干修，植临禅坐色长幽。\n影分渭北千家月，香散江南一槛秋。\n清液冰寒承露结，圆苞金重带霜收。\n会应登列西州贡，庭实宁无橘柚羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64720,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"雍孝闻","text":"官田种秫陶元亮，私釜生尘范史云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64721,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过草堂望终南山","author":"梅泽","text":"两峰高插碧天寒，虽得春风雪未乾。\n谢屐自忘登览倦，草堂终日凭栏杆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64722,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"经樊川怀杜牧之","author":"梅泽","text":"杜曲树连苍翠外，终南云暗有无中。\n清诗妙句空贻后，不见樊川一老翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64723,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行役述怀二首 其一","author":"梅泽","text":"世路侵寻老客颜，黄埃遮眼鬓毛班。\n青山未许教人去，白日何曾放我闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64724,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"行役述怀二首 其二","author":"梅泽","text":"明月一尊酒，清风万卷书。\n南山山下地，终欲卜休居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64725,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十二月立春","author":"李时","text":"东风昨夜到疏篱，早被游蜂探得知。\n花子又从今日好，人情须胜去年时。\n盘装荠菜迎春饼，瓶插梅花带雪枝。\n劝了亲庭眉寿酒，旋裁春帖换新诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64726,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柴门","author":"李时","text":"柴门尽日扃，缘是少将迎。\n但得常无事，何须更入城。\n病同愁鹤瘦，吟伴月蛩清。\n我自于时左，非干避姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64727,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄岗寓馆作","author":"李时","text":"闲居迎送少，日对小山横。\n雨过秋阳减，天虚夜气清。\n候虫依壁韵，野火隔溪明。\n迢递谁家笛，西风一雨声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64728,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松风","author":"林干","text":"白云满岩阿，松声乱飞瀑。\n中有餐霞人，悠然绝尘俗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64729,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"米拜石","author":"林干","text":"危疑欲堕石，苍然曰米拜。\n吁嗟千古情，石在米亦在。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64730,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠传灯 其一","author":"林干","text":"解印归来卧白云，风尘总不到松筠。\n身从宝盖依华座，手散天花听梵文。\n五峙法空霞作绮，一龛慧月虎成群。\n□知随处皆莲士，何事幽溪两地分。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64731,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠传灯 其二","author":"林干","text":"台教源流远，高明绍梵音。\n扶桑红日近，华顶白云深。\n清磬度山翠，黄花匝地金。\n三乘示方便，万法总惟心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64732,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠陈梦和","author":"周氏","text":"梦和残月到楼西，月过楼西梦已迷。\n唤起一声肠断处，落花枝上鹧鸪啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64733,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晴","author":"周氏","text":"瞥然飞过谁家燕，蓦地香来甚处花。\n深院日长无个事，一瓶春水自煎茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64734,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"投任伯雨诗","author":"陈师锡子","text":"恭惟持节日畿边，抗疏公车首荐贤。\n议论不能符国是，精诚直可动渊泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64735,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"周子雍","text":"风生阊阖春来早，月到蓬莱夜未中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64736,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题河南王氏所藏子敬帖","author":"黄伯思","text":"君家大令书盈纸，笔势翩翩趣多媚。\n虽云沓拖如少年，岂至拘挛同饿隶。\n会稽七子五知名，此公风概尤超诣。\n太极琁题犹重书，一时凛凛标英气。\n半袖精裓众争求，数幅新裙世犹贵。\n当时亲遇得已难，况复传今仅千岁。\n龙珠归浦剑还津，此帖君藏真得地。\n才披尺许目增明，鸾跂鸿惊欲飞逝。\n硬黄响拓若传吾，完璧摹刊愿垂世。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64737,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌臼树","author":"曾纡","text":"三年逐客弄湘流，华气遮栏两鬓秋。\n祇有荒寒江上树，尚成诗句聚眉头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64738,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和叶少蕴慈感蚌珠","author":"曾纡","text":"不知一壳几由旬，能纳须弥不动尊。\n疑是吴兴清霅水，直通方广古灵源。\n月沉浊水圆明在，莲出污泥宝性存。\n隐现去来初一致，莫将虚幻点空门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64739,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏作冷语","author":"曾纡","text":"万山云雪阴霾空，千林雾淞水摇风。\n冻河彻底连三冬，嘉平晓猎崤函中。\n十二律吕相与宫，安得此候疏烦胸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64740,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清樾轩二首 其一","author":"曾纡","text":"卧听滩声㶁㶁流，冷风凄雨似深秋。\n江边石上乌臼树，一夜水长到梢头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64741,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清樾轩二首 其二","author":"曾纡","text":"竹间嘉树密扶疏，异乡物色似吾庐。\n清晓开门出负水，已有小舟来卖鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64742,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客愁","author":"曾纡","text":"客愁如茧丝，一揽成万绪。\n秋风不可奈，又到庭前树。\n秋风自有时，客子愁无期。\n不如饮美酒，诵我山中诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64743,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宁川道中","author":"曾纡","text":"渡水穿桥一径斜，潦收溪足露汀沙。\n半山云影前山雨，十里香风晚稻花。\n异县悲秋多客思，丰年乐事属田家。\n故园正好不归去，满眼西风吹鬓华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64744,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"疏山","author":"曾纡","text":"江海相望二十年，依前肮脏倚门边。\n家风敢谓庞居士，句法空悲孟浩然。\n想见风流继莲社，应传图画入斜川。\n病夫诗思犹艰窘，正似潮回上水船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64745,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"曾纡","text":"百步桥边荡桨时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64746,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"曾纡","text":"炊烟逗疏蔼，樵径入苍苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64747,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"曾纡","text":"苔侵垂磴蔓，竹隐断岩花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64748,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拙颂奉别知事颐首兼云堂诸禅众","author":"释净如","text":"七年林下冷相依，自愧铅刀利同微。\n聚散莫云千里远，轮天一月共同晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64749,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈书记写予真求赞漫书此以塞来意","author":"释净如","text":"眉不修疏头突兀，鼻罍垂兮颧无骨。\n长怜百丑兼且讷，慈禅慈禅不我拙。\n名兮邈兮水里月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64750,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂一首","author":"释净如","text":"四大幻形，徒劳口别。\n缘会而生，缘散而灭。\n一片虚空，本无口缺。\n六十九年一梦身，临行何用忉二说。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64751,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈四首 其一","author":"释文琏","text":"诸方浩浩谈玄，每日撞钟打鼓。\n西禅无法可说，勘破灯笼露柱。\n门前不置下马台，免被傍人来借路。\n若借路，须照顾。\n脚下若参差，邯郸学唐步。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64752,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈四首 其二","author":"释文琏","text":"心生种种法生，森罗万象纵横。\n信手拈来便用，日轮午后三更。\n心灭种种法灭，四句百非路好处。\n直饶达磨出头，也是眼中著屑。\n心生心灭是谁，木人携手同归。\n归到故乡田地，犹遭顶上一锤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64753,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈四首 其三","author":"释文琏","text":"正月孟春犹寒，直下言端语端。\n拈起衲僧鼻孔，穿开佛祖心肝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64754,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其一","author":"释善悟","text":"昨日与今日，说定说不定。\n寰中天子敕，塞外将军令。\n外道当年入梦乡，直至如今犹未省。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64755,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"应廓","text":"乌鹊成桥架碧空，人间天上此欢同。\n仙槎逐浪浮银汉，青鸟传音到帝宫。\n牛女佳期情不断，古今遗恨意难穷。\n綵楼乞巧知多少，直至更阑漏欲终。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":64756,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]